{"id":"W31c9b3d31108c9b50d048e31","zh":"断轨","en":"","name":"断轨","language":"zh","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","concept_id":"C547af7ba4e6c18f54f2b","families":[],"definition_zh":"钢轨发生断裂的病害状态。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"在钢轨病害原因分析中作为断裂事件的研究对象，现有用法主要关注焊接接头处发生的断轨及其原因。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W31c9b3d31108c9b50d048e31","text":"断轨","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7da49049888362783e66","source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"采用现场调研、测试和计算分析等研究方法,对滨洲线的钢轨磨耗、三折、断轨和原始弯曲,扣件参数及接头螺栓扭矩,道床状态参数和几何参数,线路冻害和轨道不平顺等线路状态进行深入分析,总结滨洲线轨道状态之特征和变化规律,并提出养护维修之对策。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S40f8a171428ba0b0edbd","source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"1.3 断轨在复杂的气候条件下,由于钢轨受到列车荷载冲击碾压、热胀冷缩等因素的影响,在冬、春季拉应力增大的情况下,断轨现象在各个铁路局都有不同程度的发生,尤其是严寒地区 [7 -8]。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"钢轨发生断裂的病害，文中主要结合焊接接头事件分析原因。","language":"zh","source_id":"P104","paper_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W84633f15b260094067f81116","name":"rail breaking","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W84633f15b260094067f81116","name":"rail breaking","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":